  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Let us search through our own avatars.\n\nIt would be great if we could type the first 2-3 letters I named an avatar to filter my whole list of uploads instantly.\n\nIt took me a while to realize this, but I can't \"search\" through my own avatars.\n\nI have over 350 avatars uploaded, which makes it quite difficult to find specific ones.\n\nI can sort alphabetically and do that, but it would still be faster to just type a few letters.",
